> Prefer using IS_ERR_OR_NULL() over using IS_ERR() and a manual NULL
> check.
> 
> Change generated with coccinelle.
> 
> To: Eric Van Hensbergen <ericvh@kernel.org>
> To: Latchesar Ionkov <lucho@ionkov.net>
